.env
!.env.example

# Xcode
#
# User-specific Xcode state (window layout, breakpoints, scheme selections).
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# XcodeGen output.
#
# MemoryConnector/project.yml is the source of truth; MemoryConnector.xcodeproj
# is generated on the Mac build machine (`xcodegen generate`, driven by
# apps/web-ui/tools/mac-build.sh) and must never be committed. Unlike
# apps/ios/VoiceAgent.xcodeproj — which is hand-maintained and tracked — this
# project is fully reproducible from project.yml.
MemoryConnector/MemoryConnector.xcodeproj/
